    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "IN-FO.CO (Inventory Form and Content), an independent design and editorial studio in Los Angeles, CA. Founded by Adam Michaels and Shannon Harvey in 2018, building on their prior practice Project Projects (2004-2017), which won the Cooper Hewitt National Design Award for Communication Design (2015). Current team of approx. 8 people (principals + 6 staff), confirmed by in-fo.co/studio. Studio work spans graphic design, editorial, book design, identity, web design, motion graphics, exhibition and environmental design, and content development; also operates Inventory Press (books on art, architecture, design, music). Country was migration-tagged UK but is confirmed USA (LA-based). Size 2-10 confirmed via LinkedIn and team page.",
